; Dragonfruit portal backend descriptor (T-13.1a).
;
; Installed under {DATADIR}/xdg-desktop-portal/portals/; the xdg-desktop-portal
; frontend reads it to discover the backend's D-Bus name and the interfaces it
; implements. The `Interfaces=` list is empty here on purpose: T-13.1a ships
; only the service and its registration, and the first portal interfaces land
; in T-13.1b (Settings, GlobalShortcuts) and later tasks (FileChooser,
; Screenshot, ScreenCast).
[portal]
DBusName=org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.dragonfruit
Interfaces=
UseIn=dragonfruit